node_modules/
# The plain outputs are large (about 54 MB each) and stay on disk. Committed: the reference, the
# Hermes run and the bare Hermes run compressed, the diff of the Hermes run, the feature probes and
# the summaries (which carry the sha256 of every output, compressed or not).
out/**/*.json
out/**/*.gz
out/**/diff-*.txt
!out/**/summary.json
!out/features-*.json
!out/node-reference.json.gz
!out/hermes-polyfill-source.json.gz
!out/hermes-bare.json.gz
!out/diff-hermes-polyfill-source.txt
